# Buying boxes puts them on the pile; opening takes them off, one with the ritual, the rest at once.
from rich
view full
stickers off                  # new pets here can fill a book page: no sticker popups over the shots
tab boxes
expect fits
click name:amount_starter_10
click name:buy_starter
expect pile starter 10
shot bought
click name:open_starter_1
key space
wait ritual
click "lovely!"
expect pile starter 9
click name:open_starter_all
wait 4
shot opened_all
click "lovely!"
expect pile starter 0
